20
00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:06.870
David Wallace isn't the CEO?

21
00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:08.030
He's not.

22
00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:08.570
He's not.

23
00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:09.910
