24
00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:15.290
There was a very funny back and forth I saw online where people are like,

25
00:01:15.370 --> 00:01:16.970
what exactly is David Wallace?

26
00:01:16.970 --> 00:01:22.830
Like, the role of CEO would never come in and have these, like, talks with Michael.

27
00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:23.530
No, you're right.

28
00:01:23.990 --> 00:01:28.050
You know, just the way he pops in and out of the branch is not very CEO-like.

29
00:01:28.830 --> 00:01:29.950
