43
00:02:06.290 --> 00:02:06.610
I know.

44
00:02:06.970 --> 00:02:09.570
He was like, I mean, what is going on?

45
00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:10.930
This is very funny.

46
00:02:11.110 --> 00:02:14.970
Well, apparently, Alan is the biggest deal.

47
00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:19.430
At Dunder Mifflin, and he and the board make the decisions.

48
00:02:19.770 --> 00:02:20.050
Yes.

49
00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:20.710
Okay.

50
00:02:21.050 --> 00:02:21.250
Okay.

