Dwight semicolon.

62
00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:51.430
Ah!

63
00:02:52.470 --> 00:02:53.410
Exclamation point.

64
00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:58.950
But, Delaney, there were candy bag alts that were, quote, must shoot.

65
00:02:59.210 --> 00:02:59.510
Okay.

66
00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:01.710
So that means these actually got shot.

67
