68
00:03:04.770 --> 00:03:05.290
Totally.

69
00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:06.950
It was like, if time permits.

70
00:03:07.130 --> 00:03:07.330
Yeah.

71
00:03:07.550 --> 00:03:09.790
But there was must shoot and if time permits.

72
00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:10.130
Yeah.

73
00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:11.430
Here was must shoot.

74
00:03:12.110 --> 00:03:17.770
Dwight could have said, I was chasing mice in the corn crib while a fox was eating my mother's

75
00:03:17.770 --> 00:03:18.070
head.

