00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:27.620
Jenna.

142
00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:28.430
For cleanliness.

143
00:06:28.850 --> 00:06:39.070
Obviously, my way of doing the contrast hydrotherapy shower is now I sit in the hot tub and it's

